Then, dolphins were sent to all corners of the world
to gather information.
From the Yellow River to the Amazon River,
from the Arctic Ocean to the Pacific Ocean,
from the Sunda Strait to the Strait of Gibraltar,
from the Gulf of Alaska to the Gulf of Aqaba,
from the Arabian Sea to the Tasman Sea...
The dolphins traveled back and forth, collecting information.
Later, when the animals analyzed the data,
they discovered an unexpected truth!
